From 401a50512ae5868bdec9ad2bd079ce3a47bb51ed Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Long Luu <long.luu.ur@renesas.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Mar 2022 08:45:02 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 09/20] drivers: pwm: Add counter mode for GPT

This patch add counter input operation for GPT drivers.
This operation can use to count encoder signal.
Reset counter for clear counter value is used as POEG input
and can choose which reset counter pin to use via sysfs.

Signed-off-by: Long Luu <long.luu.ur@renesas.com>
Signed-off-by: Au Dang <au.dang.jx@renesas.com>
---
